msgid "Asserts on the canonical carrier that gmeow:spellingSystem is functional: a PitchSpelling expresses its name in exactly one spelling system (CMN staff, sargam, Johnston), so its system is single per relator. This record is not a definition of that term and never a shape: the obligation is reasoned from the record, not restated elsewhere."
